<title>TURKEY: Turk Tupras buys 50,000T gasoil from Stinnes, Tempo.</title>
<headline>Turk Tupras buys 50,000T gasoil from Stinnes, Tempo.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state oil refinery Tupras awarded Tempo of Geneva and Stinnes a tender to buy about 25,000 tonnes of gas oil from each company, Tupras said.</p>
<p>It said the deal with Tempo was at fob mean quotes +$11.69 per tonne and at fob mean +$10.95 a tonne with Stinnes.</p>
<p>Tempo will deliver the cargo at Izmit on April 5-9 and Stinnes at the same port on April 11-15, Tupras said.</p>
<p>The tender was held on March 18.</p>
<p>-- Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
